# Exception: the signed root-policy headers are repository inputs of the storage area.
# Only the 544-byte header and the public anchor are shipped; the full block tables stay local.
!scripts/policies/**/*.bin
*.mbn
*.fw
*.pem
*.key
.env
local.toml